checkMesh now wants `fvSchemes` (the reader's touch of the case changed what it constructs). Add minimal fvSchemes/fvSolution and re-run.

```python
open("system/fvSchemes","w").write(HEAD.format(cls="dictionary",obj="fvSchemes") + """
